### 管理者一覧表示
Get http://localhost:8080/administrators HTTP/1.1

### 管理者id検索
GET http://localhost:8080/administrators/1 HTTP/1.1

### 例外
GET http://localhost:8080/administrators/10 HTTP/1.1

### 管理者登録
POST  http://localhost:8080/administrators HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{    
    "name": "NewManager",
    "mailAddress": "new.manager@example.com",
    "password": "pass12345"
}


### 管理者削除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/administrators/4 HTTP/1.1

### 管理者更新
PUT http://localhost:8080//administrators/2 HTTP/1.1
